{"id":"0cf51aa7714e68eb","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-range.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Essential Range","display":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-range — ZFC Measure4 Essential Range","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-range","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-range"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-range — ZFC Measure4 Essential Range","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-range"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-range</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-range — ZFC Measure4 Essential Range"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c202e401aa180874\" href=\"?note=c202e401aa180874\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md\">58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,Y,\\tau,f,R\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,Y,\\tau,f,R\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq Y\">\\(R\\subseteq Y\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialRange}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialRange}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c202e401aa180874\" href=\"?note=c202e401aa180874\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md\">58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}range}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialRange}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,Y,\\tau,f,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,Y)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal B_\\tau\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathcal B_\\tau=\n\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\mid\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal B_\\tau)\n\\land R=\\{y\\in Y\\mid\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(y\\in U\\to\\mu(f^{-1}[U])&gt;0)\\}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}range}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialRange}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,Y,\\tau,f,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,Y)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal B_\\tau\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathcal B_\\tau=\n\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\mid\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal B_\\tau)\n\\land R=\\{y\\in Y\\mid\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(y\\in U\\to\\mu(f^{-1}[U])&gt;0)\\}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The Borel sigma-algebra generated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is now a bound set witness, rather than an application of an undeclared function symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"c202e401aa180874","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"c202e401aa180874","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,Y,\\tau,f,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialRange}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}range}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialRange}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,Y,\\tau,f,R)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,Y)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal B_\\tau\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathcal B_\\tau=\n\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\mid\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\land\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(f,X,\\Sigma,Y,\\mathcal B_\\tau)\n\\land R=\\{y\\in Y\\mid\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(y\\in U\\to\\mu(f^{-1}[U])>0)\\}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1877,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2593","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-range.md|58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-range]]（batch01）"}